"Requested revision: '%(spec)s' does not exist in branch: "
"%(branch_url)s%(extra)s"
msgstr ""
"Zahtjevana revizija: '%(spec)s'  nije sadrzana u grani: "
"%(branch_url)s%(extra)s"

