msgid ""
"Selected merge cannot perform reverse cherrypicks.  Try merge3 or diff3."
msgstr ""
"Oznaceno spajanje ne moze da izvrsi obrnuti cherrypicks. Pokusajte merge3 "
"ili diff3."

