"BZR_SSH             Path to SSH client, or one of paramiko, openssh, "
"sshcorp,\n"
"                    plink or lsh.\n"
"BZR_LOG             Location of .bzr.log (use '/dev/null' to suppress log).\n"
"BZR_LOG (Win32)     Location of .bzr.log (use 'NUL' to suppress log).\n"
