msgstr "Predstavljen u: 1.17"

#: en/help_topics/hooks.txt:186
msgid ""
"Called when creating a single command. Called with (cmd_or_None,\n"
"command_name). get_command should either return the cmd_or_None\n"
"parameter, or a replacement Command object that should be used for the\n"
"command. Note that the Command.hooks hooks are core infrastructure.\n"
"Many users will prefer to use bzrlib.commands.register_command or\n"
"plugin_cmds.register_lazy."
msgstr ""
"Pozvano pri kreiranju jedne komandePozvano sa (cmd_or_None,\n"
"command_name). get_command treba vratiti ili cmd_or_None\n"
"parametar, ili zamjenu za komandni objekat koji treba da bude korišten za\n"
"komandu. Pazite na to da su Command.hooks kuke srž infrastrukture.\n"
"Mnogo korisnika preferira koristiti bzrlib.commands.register_command ili\n"
"plugin_cmds.register_lazy."

