"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"
msgstr ""
"get_missing_command\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"

#: en/help_topics/hooks.txt:198
msgid ""
"Called when creating a single command if no command could be found.\n"
"Called with (command_name). get_missing_command should either return\n"
"None, or a Command object to be used for the command."
msgstr ""
"Zahtjevati  pravljenje slobodne komande ako ni jedna komanda ne može biti "
"pronađena.\n"
"Zahtjevati sa (command_name). get_missing_command treba bilo koji povratak "
"None, ili Command objekat da bude korištena kao komanda."

