"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"
msgstr ""
"merge_file_content\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"

#: en/help_topics/hooks.txt:314
msgid "Introduced in: 2.1"
msgstr "Predstavljen u: 2.1"

#: en/help_topics/hooks.txt:316
msgid ""
"Called with a bzrlib.merge.Merger object to create a per file merge\n"
"object when starting a merge. Should return either None or a subclass\n"
"of ``bzrlib.merge.AbstractPerFileMerger``. Such objects will then be\n"
"called per file that needs to be merged (including when one side has\n"
"deleted the file and the other has changed it). See the\n"
"AbstractPerFileMerger API docs for details on how it is used by merge."
msgstr ""
"Pozvano sa bzrlib.merge.Merger objektom da stvori objekat spajanja po\n"
"datoteci kada počinje spajanje. Treba vratiti ili None ili podklasu od\n"
"``bzrlib.merge.AbstractPerFileMerger``. Takvi objekti će onda biti\n"
"pozvani po datoteci koja treba da se spoji (uključujući kada jedna strana "
"je\n"
"izbrisala datoteku a druga je promijenila). Vidite\n"
"AbstractPerFileMerger API za detalje kako da se koristi pri spajanju."

