msgstr ""
"MessageEditorHooks\n"
"------------------"

#: en/help_topics/hooks.txt:354
msgid ""
"commit_message_template\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"
msgstr ""
"commit_message_template\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"

#: en/help_topics/hooks.txt:357
msgid "Introduced in: 1.10"
msgstr "Predstavljen u: 1.10"

#: en/help_topics/hooks.txt:359
msgid ""
"Called when a commit message is being generated.\n"
"commit_message_template is called with the bzrlib.commit.Commit object\n"
"and the message that is known so far. commit_message_template must\n"
"return a new message to use (which could be the same as it was given).\n"
"When there are multiple hooks registered for commit_message_template,\n"
"they are chained with the result from the first passed into the\n"
"second, and so on."
msgstr ""
"Pozvano kada se generiše poruka izvršenja.\n"
"commit_message_template je pozvano bzrlib.commit.Commit objektom\n"
"i porukom koja je poznata do sada. commit_message_template mora\n"
"vratiti novu poruku da koristi (koja može biti ista kao ona data).\n"
"Kada ima više registrovanih kuka za commit_message_template,\n"
"povezane su sa rezultatom iz prve poslane u drugu itd.."

#: en/help_topics/hooks.txt:367
msgid ""
"set_commit_message\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"
msgstr ""
"set_commit_message\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~"

#: en/help_topics/hooks.txt:372
msgid ""
"Set a fixed commit message. set_commit_message is called with the\n"
"bzrlib.commit.Commit object (so you can also change e.g. revision\n"
"properties by editing commit.builder._revprops) and the message so\n"
"far. set_commit_message must return the message to use or None if it\n"
"should use the message editor as normal."
msgstr ""
"Postavifiksnu poruku izvršavanja. set_commit_message je pozvana sa\n"
"bzrlib.commit.Commit objektom (možete isto promijeniti npr. postavke\n"
"revizije mijenjanjem commit.builder._revprops) i porukom do sada\n"
". set_commit_message treba vratiti poruku da koristi None ako\n"
"treba koristiti dorađivač poruka kao inače."

